  "worked_solution": "Since each part is $\\frac{1}{8}$ of a whole, we need to split each of the $3$ dishes (wholes) into $8$ equal parts, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129499/assets/55be423192cc332d4c8d98223eded4ac3bbed40b36694637912e47a415de9de5.png)\n\n \n\nSo, we get $3\\times 8=24$ pieces in total.",
